WEBVTT

00:19.954 --> 00:24.258
The wound inside my sealed memories

00:24.258 --> 00:28.929
When it silently touches the heart

00:28.929 --> 00:36.392
Tears of loneliness behind
the gentle smile

00:36.637 --> 00:41.442
I seek boundless strength

00:41.442 --> 00:52.219
I continue to run up with
what I believe in

00:52.219 --> 00:54.355
I want to protect

00:54.355 --> 00:56.557
I want to believe

00:56.557 --> 01:00.828
all the reasons for that smile

01:00.828 --> 01:05.265
The heat and the love

01:05.265 --> 01:09.436
I accept them all

01:09.436 --> 01:13.140
I won't let go of your hand again

01:13.140 --> 01:21.946
Aiming towards that light...

01:32.192 --> 01:35.218
Previously on Shonen Onmyouji...

01:39.666 --> 01:42.603
If you die here, I'll be
the one in deep trouble!

01:42.603 --> 01:46.733
I wouldn't be happy to survive
if I have to sacrifice you!

01:47.975 --> 01:51.045
I'm aiming to become
a great onmyouji.

01:51.045 --> 01:52.239
One who won't sacrifice
anyone.

01:54.615 --> 01:59.319
A strange power has
arisen in the distant west.

01:59.319 --> 02:03.847
It seems a disaster
will soon befall men...

02:04.324 --> 02:06.860
Those like you are
nothing more...

02:06.860 --> 02:09.522
than worms in front
of my master...

02:09.930 --> 02:12.728
Be told that there's
no salvation for you!

02:13.967 --> 02:16.492
Maybe it went back to
its master's place...

02:17.371 --> 02:18.739
I know, I know!

02:18.739 --> 02:23.972
A huge house outside Ukyou!
I saw it go inside.

02:25.746 --> 02:28.874
Repel the Raging Demons

02:30.250 --> 02:32.081
This is it...

02:32.853 --> 02:34.788
There's something strange here.

02:34.788 --> 02:38.280
- There're no sounds of insects.
- That's true.

02:43.597 --> 02:46.691
This silence makes it
even more suspicious...

02:50.571 --> 02:52.232
Masahiro!

03:03.016 --> 03:04.745
Mokkun!

03:15.262 --> 03:17.992
- Guren.
- It's there.

03:18.065 --> 03:20.567
I sense a stronger
evil presence...

03:20.567 --> 03:23.127
that's neither Banban
nor Gouetsu.

03:23.637 --> 03:27.801
Yeah, there are a lot of
foreign demons here.

03:45.859 --> 03:49.229
We will offer you
to our master.

03:49.229 --> 03:51.565
A prey that is like no other.

03:51.565 --> 03:55.524
This child wields the
finest spiritual power.

03:57.070 --> 04:01.302
Don't think that you underlings
will be able to touch Masahiro.

04:14.454 --> 04:17.582
- Coming! They're coming!
- Yeah.

04:22.229 --> 04:26.689
[chant]

04:28.802 --> 04:32.533
Guren, their leader is probably
around here somewhere.

04:33.273 --> 04:35.104
I'll make a path.

04:42.316 --> 04:43.840
Let's go.

04:45.852 --> 04:47.786
Lord Kyuuki.

04:47.888 --> 04:51.380
My body... Lord Kyuuki!

04:53.560 --> 04:56.654
Do not call my name so easily.

04:57.698 --> 04:59.533
It's only a child of a human,

04:59.533 --> 05:01.702
and a deity that's
serving a human.

05:01.702 --> 05:04.535
What causes you so
much difficulty?

05:12.212 --> 05:13.880
Honor the power within.

05:13.880 --> 05:16.016
O spirits that descended
before the dawn of man.

05:16.016 --> 05:18.518
Extinguish the hundred demons.
Put down the evil.

05:18.518 --> 05:21.043
Ten thousand demons, enfold!

05:23.657 --> 05:27.525
I couldn't get rid of them all.
One more time.

05:32.266 --> 05:34.601
Think twice before
using your spells.

05:34.601 --> 05:37.237
There's a limit to your spiritual
and physical energy.

05:37.237 --> 05:39.432
I know that.

05:48.749 --> 05:50.512
He's...

05:50.851 --> 05:54.014
You actually came here
to be eaten...

05:56.657 --> 05:59.660
He's the one the
demons call "Master".

05:59.660 --> 06:02.362
Oh child who wields the
finest spiritual power.

06:02.362 --> 06:05.354
Become my sacrifice.

06:23.884 --> 06:26.011
That's... Kyuuki?

06:26.753 --> 06:28.188
Kyuuki?

06:28.188 --> 06:31.325
A legendary monster said to come
from the distant west.

06:31.325 --> 06:33.627
He looks like a bull,
but it's rumored that...

06:33.627 --> 06:35.925
he can transform into
a tiger with wings.

06:36.296 --> 06:41.165
Also, he likes to feast on
women with long hair.

06:41.201 --> 06:44.364
So that's why Banban
targeted Akiko.

06:46.206 --> 06:50.377
This spiritual power is fitting.

06:50.377 --> 06:54.746
Long-haired... with that...

07:01.555 --> 07:03.614
This evil aura!

07:03.690 --> 07:07.217
Are you afraid?
Well, I'd understand.

07:07.294 --> 07:08.784
Shut up!

07:09.363 --> 07:11.698
Kyuuki, why did you
come to this city...

07:11.698 --> 07:13.859
from the distant lands
of the west?

07:13.900 --> 07:16.803
To create a place
for me to live.

07:16.803 --> 07:21.240
After healing this wound,
that is...

07:22.175 --> 07:26.077
It looks like you lost a fight
with another demon over territory.

07:45.932 --> 07:47.832
Get out of the way!

07:52.239 --> 07:56.573
[chant]

08:01.448 --> 08:03.780
You're using your spells
too much, Masahiro.

08:06.686 --> 08:08.916
One after the other.

08:11.124 --> 08:12.648
Guren!

08:13.193 --> 08:17.097
By imperial command of the
Jade Emperor, bind this evil!

08:17.097 --> 08:20.760
Charm of the sacred treasure!
Entrap the demons, now!

08:25.672 --> 08:27.264
Masahiro!

08:45.859 --> 08:48.295
With this much spiritual power,

08:48.295 --> 08:51.594
my wound will be healed
instantly.

08:53.900 --> 08:57.204
I can't... At least Guren...

08:57.204 --> 09:00.367
I can't let Guren die...

09:01.408 --> 09:03.933
You struggle in vain.

09:04.211 --> 09:06.213
Just an instant is enough.

09:06.213 --> 09:09.382
If there's a chance
to create an opening...

09:09.382 --> 09:12.943
Masahiro! Where are you,
Masahiro!

09:15.856 --> 09:17.424
Masahiro!

09:17.424 --> 09:19.392
I desire while lying below...

09:19.526 --> 09:22.461
Stop it! For you,
that spell is!

09:23.129 --> 09:24.994
Masahiro!

09:25.365 --> 09:28.235
Run. I'll create a distraction.

09:28.235 --> 09:31.938
That's enough.
Go back to Grandfather.

09:31.938 --> 09:34.174
You're Grandfather's shikigami,

09:34.174 --> 09:37.244
so I can't let you die
in a place like this.

09:37.244 --> 09:39.012
Stop it! Masahiro!

09:39.012 --> 09:42.015
Come to me, blade of light,
cut through the darkness!

09:42.015 --> 09:45.348
Sword of lightning, slash this
place with your silver light.

09:45.986 --> 09:49.888
Come forth now,
O magnificent lightning!

10:13.146 --> 10:15.482
You pathetic brat!

10:15.482 --> 10:18.952
You actually believe
you could harm me...

10:18.952 --> 10:21.011
with a spell like that?

10:59.259 --> 11:01.454
How dare you interfere?

11:13.707 --> 11:16.509
What are you doing?
Why didn't you run away?

11:16.509 --> 11:19.279
I summoned the lightning god
that I'm not used to yet,

11:19.279 --> 11:21.648
so that you could flee
during the diversion...

11:21.648 --> 11:23.483
Guren, you're so stupid.

11:23.483 --> 11:25.719
You're so badly injured.

11:25.719 --> 11:28.916
Even the 12 shikigami spirit
aren't immortal.

11:29.022 --> 11:31.257
What if you die?

11:31.257 --> 11:32.959
Don't worry...

11:32.959 --> 11:37.130
If you die here, I'll be
the one in deep trouble!

11:37.130 --> 11:40.567
Why? You said that
before too.

11:40.567 --> 11:44.070
In a place you don't
even know,

11:44.070 --> 11:47.335
- you gave me light.
- What?

11:52.278 --> 11:56.383
Those with the second sight
all feared me.

11:56.383 --> 11:58.510
But only you, Masahiro.

11:59.119 --> 12:02.885
You didn't flinch in front of me,
Touda, whom everyone feared.

12:04.257 --> 12:06.623
You looked at me
straight in the eye.

12:15.835 --> 12:19.202
And you smiled happily.

12:20.407 --> 12:23.843
To keep that exceptional
strength pure...

12:29.683 --> 12:32.481
I decided to protect you.

12:33.119 --> 12:35.655
Ever since the time I met you...

12:35.655 --> 12:37.850
And from now on...

12:39.059 --> 12:42.328
What is it, Guren?
What did you say?

12:42.328 --> 12:45.598
You're going to be an onmyouji.
The ultimate one.

12:45.598 --> 12:48.328
The one that will
surpass Seimei.

12:48.735 --> 12:51.838
Do you think I'd let you
die in a place like this?

12:51.838 --> 12:55.475
If you die, I'll be in
deep trouble too!

12:55.475 --> 12:58.478
If you weren't here,
I'd be so lonely!

12:58.478 --> 13:00.878
And... And...

13:11.291 --> 13:13.760
I'm going to be
a great onmyouji.

13:13.760 --> 13:16.194
So Guren, you'd better
watch me become one!

13:19.332 --> 13:22.597
If you die in a place like this,
I won't forgive you!

13:23.036 --> 13:26.339
You have to be kidding me,
you foreign demons.

13:26.339 --> 13:28.500
I'm seriously angry!

13:30.143 --> 13:32.373
I can't give up!

13:32.812 --> 13:34.547
[chant]

13:34.547 --> 13:36.845
Stop it, Masahiro!

13:41.921 --> 13:43.479
What?

14:00.006 --> 14:01.997
Who are you?

14:03.676 --> 14:07.305
Oh, no one in particular.

14:07.413 --> 14:10.383
What? I wonder who that is.

14:10.383 --> 14:12.719
The ones around him
are shikigami?

14:12.719 --> 14:16.790
Amazing. He has even more
spiritual power than that child!

14:16.790 --> 14:19.657
I will eat you both!

14:20.426 --> 14:22.394
Don't delude yourself.

14:25.565 --> 14:27.400
Honor the power within.

14:27.400 --> 14:29.891
O spirits that descended
before the dawn of man.

14:29.936 --> 14:32.097
You wretched priest!

15:01.000 --> 15:03.937
Extinguish the hundred demons.
Put down the evil.

15:03.937 --> 15:05.104
Watch out!

15:05.104 --> 15:07.868
[chant]

15:12.846 --> 15:15.715
- Masahiro!
- I'm fine.

15:15.715 --> 15:17.450
Don't try so hard.

15:17.450 --> 15:21.352
But I can't just stay
quiet and watch.

15:27.627 --> 15:29.754
Ten thousand demons! Enfold!

15:44.844 --> 15:46.641
Darn you!

16:14.240 --> 16:16.009
What's this?

16:16.009 --> 16:17.909
Are you all right, Guren?

16:18.144 --> 16:19.873
Your wounds are healed?

16:19.979 --> 16:23.983
Hey... It doesn't hurt anywhere.

16:23.983 --> 16:26.619
I didn't know such
a great onmyouji exists!

16:26.619 --> 16:29.383
I thought Grandfather
was the best.

16:29.722 --> 16:32.589
If there's an onmyouji with
such great power...

16:39.065 --> 16:40.726
He's gone.

16:43.937 --> 16:46.030
Masahiro, let's go home.

16:48.675 --> 16:51.044
- Does it still hurt anywhere?
- No.

16:51.044 --> 16:52.671
Let's go home.

17:06.192 --> 17:08.628
That was a long night.

17:08.628 --> 17:11.064
Mokkun, you should
have a good rest too.

17:11.064 --> 17:12.531
Mokkun?

17:15.835 --> 17:17.894
Mokkun, where are
you going?

17:20.974 --> 17:24.375
Hey, wait, Mokkun! Grandfather
is probably sleeping!

17:24.477 --> 17:27.173
Seimei, why did you
act so rashly?!

17:28.881 --> 17:31.351
Seimei! Wake up, Seimei!

17:31.351 --> 17:33.842
What is he so angry about?

17:37.623 --> 17:40.114
One of the
12 shikigami spirit?

17:40.626 --> 17:42.695
My name is Tenitsu.

17:42.695 --> 17:45.198
Please don't hesitate
to come in.

17:45.198 --> 17:47.200
Why did you send your spirit?

17:47.200 --> 17:50.336
What if your body was harmed
during the process?

17:50.336 --> 17:54.007
- That would be the end of you!
- I wouldn't make such a mistake.

17:54.007 --> 17:57.677
I had Seiryuu and Genbu
protecting me here.

17:57.677 --> 17:59.145
It's all right.

17:59.145 --> 18:01.238
But still, think of your age!

18:03.883 --> 18:07.842
Oh, Masahiro! That was
very dangerous, wasn't it?

18:07.987 --> 18:10.256
If you can't handle
such a situation...

18:10.256 --> 18:12.258
without taking
unnecessary risks,

18:12.258 --> 18:16.996
- I can't retire without worries!
- What?!

18:16.996 --> 18:19.432
Although I thought that
I shouldn't interfere,

18:19.432 --> 18:23.102
I got involved and
tried to help.

18:23.102 --> 18:26.833
What? Grandfather,
what do you mean by that?

18:30.610 --> 18:34.447
Seimei sent his spirit
over to help you.

18:34.447 --> 18:37.984
You didn't even realize that?
I can't believe it!

18:37.984 --> 18:40.720
Seimei is like that.

18:40.720 --> 18:42.688
You're the ones from before!

18:43.156 --> 18:45.716
You'd better train well.

18:52.298 --> 18:55.735
So that means the one
who saved us...

18:55.735 --> 18:58.538
was Grandfather and
the 12 shikigami spirit?

18:58.538 --> 19:01.996
Just by letting your spirit
fly out of your body...

19:02.475 --> 19:03.976
Masahiro...

19:03.976 --> 19:06.312
They were just dispersed
to different areas.

19:06.312 --> 19:08.114
They're still hiding
somewhere.

19:08.114 --> 19:13.609
I had put in my heart and soul
teaching you so many things!

19:13.953 --> 19:18.617
You should be able to wipe out
a demon like that with ease.

19:19.592 --> 19:24.825
At this rate, you can't possibly
become the ultimate onmyouji.

19:25.398 --> 19:27.433
Your dreams will be crushed...

19:27.433 --> 19:30.770
just because I did a poor
job in teaching you.

19:30.770 --> 19:33.933
Oh, how sad.
Grandfather is very sad.

19:34.507 --> 19:38.568
I understand! I'll go and
slay those demons!

19:38.811 --> 19:40.836
You can be sure I will!

19:41.581 --> 19:43.674
I'm going to sleep,
so good night!

19:44.550 --> 19:49.088
There we go. He's so easy
to handle, as always.

19:49.088 --> 19:51.691
Seimei, he'll hate you
one day.

19:51.691 --> 19:54.694
Oh, there's nothing
to worry about,

19:54.694 --> 19:57.363
since I love Masahiro
very much.

19:57.363 --> 20:00.264
Everything just looks like
the opposite of love.

20:01.667 --> 20:06.372
Guren, you'd better become
more disciplined as well.

20:06.372 --> 20:09.075
Isn't that what you intended...

20:09.075 --> 20:12.135
by stepping down
as my shikigami?

20:13.246 --> 20:17.080
I wanted to become
Masahiro's protector.

20:17.884 --> 20:22.048
I'll protect Masahiro,
as well as my own life.

20:33.966 --> 20:35.701
M-Masahiro?

20:35.701 --> 20:39.805
So what's with that,
"Your dreams will be crushed...

20:39.805 --> 20:43.676
just because I did a
poor job in teaching you"?

20:43.676 --> 20:45.878
How on earth can
a normal onmyouji...

20:45.878 --> 20:49.081
let his spirit leave his
body the way a demon can?

20:49.081 --> 20:52.018
If he was watching right
from the start,

20:52.018 --> 20:55.154
he should have come before
Guren was so badly injured!

20:55.154 --> 20:58.224
If deities are hurt, they feel
the pain and bleed too!

20:58.224 --> 21:00.526
That cold-blooded raccoon!

21:00.526 --> 21:04.197
Of course, it's partly my
fault that I'm still a trainee.

21:04.197 --> 21:06.324
But still!

21:08.267 --> 21:10.201
- Mokkun!
- Yes!

21:10.670 --> 21:15.174
I'll do it! I'll destroy
all those demons myself!

21:15.174 --> 21:17.142
So, lend me
your strength!

21:22.348 --> 21:24.684
All right! I'll do it!

21:24.684 --> 21:28.950
Just watch, you old raccoon!

21:42.868 --> 21:54.280
I heard your voice inside
the deep darkness

21:54.280 --> 22:05.791
Just your phrase "I believe"
echoed in my heart

22:05.791 --> 22:11.564
You always stayed by my side

22:11.564 --> 22:16.900
You always gave me courage

22:19.405 --> 22:29.715
In order to continue
protecting our future

22:29.715 --> 22:36.389
I promise you, my beloved

22:36.389 --> 22:41.727
I won't give up

22:41.727 --> 22:47.466
I will keep overcoming my limits

22:47.466 --> 22:54.668
Surely surely surely

23:00.012 --> 23:02.640
Next Episode

23:23.903 --> 23:25.371
Next on Shonen Onmyouji...

23:25.371 --> 23:26.702
Episode 6.

23:26.772 --> 23:26.906
Grab the Sign Emerging
from the Darkness.

23:26.906 --> 23:29.108
Episode 6
Grab the Sign Emerging
from the Darkness
Grab the Sign Emerging
from the Darkness.
